Database Queries:

1- CREATE DATABASE db_name;                                 -- Ye Esliye Hoti ki Data Base Ko crate karne ke liye 
2- CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS db name;                   -- jab Bhi Haam Data Base Create karte hai to condition add kar dete hai  Agr mera  Data Base Exist nahi karta hai to hi DataBase bana hai Done 

3- DROP DATABASE db name;                                   -- Yaha Haam Apne Dtaa Base Ko Drop kar dete hai matlb ki Delete kar dena From Data base
4- DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS db_name;                         -- Ye To malum hi hia kaab Kaam Ati hai jab Pahele se hi dataDrop hai To check karke usse usse then drop karo , Arey matlb agr data base exits karta hai tabhi ussse drop karna hai theek hai 

5- SHOW DATABASES;                                          -- Ye ham hamre  sare data-Base ko Dikha deta hai ki hamne Kitne Data BSe banaya hai 
6- SHOW TABLES;                                             -- Agr mai Kissi Data BAse ke Andhr uski sari table ko dekhna chahata hun to we can excuate this quesry ok which help to display all the tables in our data base 